<ul><li><small>NHS patterns: <a href="https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/patterns/question-pages">question pages</a>, <a href="https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/patterns/know-that-a-page-is-up-to-date">know that a page is up to date</a>, <a href="https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/patterns/ask-for-nhs-numbers">ask for NHS numbers</a>, <a href="https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/patterns/start-page">start page</a>, <a href="https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/patterns/find-bsl-content">find BSL content</a>, <a href="https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/patterns/a-to-z-page">A to Z page</a>, <a href="https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/patterns/check-answers">check answers</a>, <a href="https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/patterns/complete-multiple-tasks">complete multiple tasks</a>, <a href="https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/patterns/confirmation-page">confirmation page</a>, <a href="https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/patterns/hub-page">hub page</a>, <a href="https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/patterns/mini-hub">mini hub</a>, <a href="https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/patterns/interruption-page">interruption page</a> and <a href="https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/patterns/help-users-decide-when-and-where-to-get-care">help users decide when and where to get care</a>.</small></li>
